"alibaba/lowcode-engine","name":"lowcode-engine","boards":{}},{"full_name":"alibaba/nacos","name":"nacos","boards":{}},{"full_name":"alibaba/open-code-review","name":"open-code-review","boards":{"daily":10,"weekly":102,"monthly":97,"daily_rate":83,"monthly_rate":175,"daily_forks":25,"daily_watchers":182}},{"full_name":"alibaba/p3c","name":"p3c","boards":{}}],"issues":[{"number":3306,"title":"在哪里可以关注到Weex2.0的进展","comments":47,"created_at":"2022-06-14T10:26:31Z"},{"number":3346,"title":"【OpenHarmony】【weex】当前Weex框架，没有鸿蒙SDK版本，请问我们能否在weex仓库新增一套集成到鸿蒙的能力？","comments":19,"created_at":"2024-09-11T02:47:20Z"},{"number":3249,"title":"[Android] 0.30.2 text 组件多行下，div高度不对","comments":11,"created_at":"2021-08-18T02:33:04Z"},{"number":3229,"title":"应用层如何基于weex0.30进行折叠屏的适配？","comments":10,"created_at":"2021-06-15T09:58:17Z"},{"number":3210,"title":"Migrate Apache Weex to alibaba/weex","comments":10,"created_at":"2021-05-17T01:42:57Z"},{"number":3351,"title":" Unsupported URL Type: npm:string-width@^4.2.0","comments":6,"created_at":"2024-11-04T02:58:16Z"},{"number":3327,"title":"我想问一下，Weex什么时候会升级到1.0.0版本？I really want to know that, when will Weex release version 1.0.0?","comments":5,"created_at":"2023-04-18T05:54:37Z"},{"number":3272,"title":" iOS weex0.30.0版本支持暗黑模式还有ipad适配的文档麻烦提供一下呢","comments":5,"created_at":"2021-12-09T07:43:04Z"}],"discussions":[],"latest_release":{"name":"0.30.0","tag":"0.30.0","published_at":"2021-05-24T02:43:07Z","body":"## Feature\r\n\r\n### iOS\r\n\r\n* darkmode支持\r\n* 适配iPad设备\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Android\r\n\r\n* 适配折叠屏\r\n* Weex Android R 和 Targetsdk 29 适配\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Main Bugfix\r\n\r\n### iOS\r\n\r\n* web组件默认使用WKWebView实现\r\n* 修复剪切板模块未在主线程调用，在iOS13上返回失败\r\n* iOS Toast快速点击，可以取消之前的toast，而不是按顺序弹出\r\n* 修复waterfall组件loadmore的时候会导致全部重绘问题\r\n* 修复richtext组件crash问题\r\n* 修复当多线程调用initSDKEnvironment方法时，会概率crash\r\n* 修复图片在iOS14无法显示问题\r\n* 修复waterfall组件概率crash问题\r\n* 修复ios14下文本高度计算错误问题\r\n* 适配iOS14下UIDatePicker样式问题\r\n* richtext新增selectable属性，允许业务禁止选择事件\r\n* 修复页面pan手势与系统屏幕侧滑返回手势冲突问题\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Android\r\n\r\n* 修复在 renderError 产生的情况下还会重启子进程, 如果发生 5s 检测白屏重启子进程, 此时新增重启 JSThread\r\n* 修复 Weex CallNativeModule 偶现 invoker 为空的问题\r\n* 修复weexcore mmap泄漏以及子进程挂掉后存在僵尸进程的问题\r\n* 修复多线程渲染导致 crash 的问题  \r\n\r\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}